{
  "id": "deep_bruk_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "A toll post on a road the guild stopped tolling, three dark lamps above it, and a man sitting under them with a book."
        },
        {
          "text": "“No toll,” he says. “Has not been for two hundred years. I sit here.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_bruk_out",
          "text": "Three lamps out, all by you.",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "deep_lamps_out"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                13,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_wayfinders",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "deep_bruk_out_told",
            "onFailure": "deep_bruk_out_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "deep_bruk_hollow",
          "text": "You are the only person who sits on this road. Does the bridge sound right to you?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "deep_bridge_footings"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "insight",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                15,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_wayfinders",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "deep_bruk_hollow_told",
            "onFailure": "deep_bruk_hollow_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "deep_bruk_tally",
          "text": "The tally. Every year of it.",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "items": [
                "toll_tally"
              ],
              "flags": [
                {
                  "flag": "given:toll_tally"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                15,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_wayfinders",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "deep_bruk_tally_gave",
            "onFailure": "deep_bruk_tally_kept"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_bruk_out_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“All three, and I have sat under them for thirty years.” He does not look up. “They went out one after another, a year apart, and they went out in order going away from me.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "deep_lamps_out"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_bruk_out_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_bruk_out_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_wayfinders",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_bruk_out_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_bruk_hollow_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“It sounds hollow at the ends.” He says it as a fact about masonry, which is how he has kept it bearable. “Ring what it stands on and it answers. Ring the cliff and it does not. There is a room in each pier and there has been the whole time.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "deep_bridge_footings"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_bruk_hollow_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_bruk_hollow_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_wayfinders",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_bruk_hollow_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_bruk_tally_gave",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "He hands it over without looking at it. “Three years in a different ink,” he says. “Not my father's hand and not mine. I have never worked out whose, and I have had thirty years of sitting here to work it out in.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "grantItem": {
            "target": {
              "ref": "actor.id"
            },
            "item": "toll_tally",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "setFlag": {
            "flag": "given:toll_tally",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_bruk_tally_thanks",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_bruk_tally_kept",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“It is the post's,” he says. “I am the post.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_wayfinders",
            "amount": -2
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_bruk_tally_leave",
          "text": "Then no.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    }
  ]
}
